  "content_html": "<p style=\"text-align: right;\"></p><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhxDGx_qmX14ok1nBgAhSATxn994nqswcaXr4bdwayTyCW00iselJZT1ym2Q9aF_ZJmd6FxN3ALrMWvLeMX9I3flKSKRrgFq3RmodgY3Vhpl7EXR2hGk_0ytAcFL8Ivx5L7w_E8Y0fq6OTo3uZXFPNahWwKu5qWuF3GexB4iFv_fTWOlj_RBp-5pvY_EV4/s1024/ChatGPT%20Image%20May%201,%202025,%2004_01_07%20PM.png\"><img alt=\"אנשים ערמומיים חוטפים רכוש אחרים\" border=\"0\" height=\"320\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhxDGx_qmX14ok1nBgAhSATxn994nqswcaXr4bdwayTyCW00iselJZT1ym2Q9aF_ZJmd6FxN3ALrMWvLeMX9I3flKSKRrgFq3RmodgY3Vhpl7EXR2hGk_0ytAcFL8Ivx5L7w_E8Y0fq6OTo3uZXFPNahWwKu5qWuF3GexB4iFv_fTWOlj_RBp-5pvY_EV4/w320-h320/ChatGPT%20Image%20May%201,%202025,%2004_01_07%20PM.png\" width=\"320\" /></a></div><h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: large;\">גנב סדרתי</span></h2><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><blockquote>לֹא תִּגְנֹבוּ וְלֹא תְכַחֲשׁוּ וְלֹא תְשַׁקְּרוּ אִישׁ בַּעֲמִיתוֹ</blockquote></div></span><div><span style=\"background-color: #fcfcfc; color: #202122;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: large;\"><br /></span></span></div>🐑🐑<p></p><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">פַּעַם, בְּרֵאשִׁית הַהִיסְטוֹרִיָּה,</span></p><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">גָּנְבוּ כְּבָשִׂים, עִזִּים אוֹ תְּרָפִים.</span></p><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"> בְּהֶמְשֵׁךְ הוּרְחֲבָה הַקָּטֶגוֹרְיָה,</span></p><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">לִבְנֵי אָדָם, כֵּלִים וּכְסָפִים.</span></p><p></p><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">🦹‍♂️🦹‍♂️</span></p><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">אֲבָל, כְּפִי שֶׁיָּדוּעַ,</span></p><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">\"עִם הָאֹכֶל בָּא הַתֵּיאָבוֹן\".</span></p><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">גַּנָּבִים מְנַצְּלִים כָּל אֵרוּעַ,</span></p><div style=\"text-align: right;\"><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">מִזְּמַן \"לֹא דוֹפְקִים חֶשְׁבּוֹן\".</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">🚲🚲</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">לוֹקְחִים מִן הַבָּא לַיָּד,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">אוֹפַנַּיִם, תֹּכֶן אוֹ זֶהוּת.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">חַשְׁמַל אוֹ טֶלֶפוֹן נַיָּד,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">וְסְתָם יְצִירוֹת אֻמָּנוּת.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">🎩🔥</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">הַיּוֹם, כְּבָר לֹא תוֹלִים גַּנָּבִים,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">זֶה עֹנֶשׁ לֹא מִידָּתִי.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">הֵם לֹא הוֹלְכִים עִם \"כּוֹבָעִים בּוֹעֲרִים\",</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">זֶה כְּבָר מִזְּמַן \"לֹא אֳפְנָתִי\".</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">📏📏</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">לְאַחֲרוֹנָה, חוּשׁ הַצֶּדֶק אָבַד,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">וְהַפְּרוֹפּוֹרְצְיָה&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">וּ</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">קְנֵה הַמִּדָּה.</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">כִּי תָּפְסוּ לְפָחוֹת שַׂר אֶחָד,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">שֶׁגָּנַב מִקֻּפַּת הַמְּדִינָה.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">🖼️🖼️</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">וּבִכְלָל, אִם תִּגְנֹב כַּרְטִיס וִיזָה,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">יֹאמְרוּ שֶׁבָּאתָ מִמָּרוֹקוֹ.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">אֲבָל אִם תִּגְנֹב מוֹנָה לִיזָה,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">יַעֲשׂוּ עָלֶיךָ דוֹקוֹ.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">☢️☢️</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">יְלָדִים – גּוֹנְבִים אֲפִיקוֹמָן,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">סוֹכְנִים – אֶת סוֹדוֹת הַגַּרְעִין.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">בַּנְקָאִים לוֹקְחִים מְזוּמָן,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">נִשְׁאָרִים עִם כָּל הַמוֹנִיטִין.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">🏰🏰</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">טִיבָם שֶׁל בְּנֵי אֱנוֹשׁ,</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">לִשְׁתּוֹת מַיִם גְּנוּבִים – בְּצָמָא.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">וְ-\"יוֹסֶלֶ'ה גַּנָּב קָדוֹשׁ\",</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">נִשְׁאַר סִפּוּר אַגָּדָה.</span></p><div style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">🎵🎵<span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><br /></span></span><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">אֲבָל לַמְרוֹת הַכֹּל, עוֹדֵנִי,</span></p><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">גָּנוּב עַל אֶרֶץ הָעִבְרִים.</span></p><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">וְאִם הַחֲשָׁשׁ מִתְגַּנֵּב לִי,</span></p><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">אֲנִי פָּשׁוּט כּוֹתֵב שִׁירִים...</span></p></div></div>"
}
